
# pass78-bak-exclude: keep sandbox rollback *.bak* backups OUT of the prod build context.
# (the .bak files remain on disk as documented FX-build rollback points — this only
#  excludes them from the image, per Commander's non-destructive request 2026-06-04.)
**/*.bak*
*.bak*
**/*.orig
*.orig
**/*~
